on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>450</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Ada Fen says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Ada Fen:</b> I&#39;ll put this jar on the high shelf. He&#39;ll have to admit it if he wants the ladder.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"I&#39;ll put this jar on the high shelf. He&#39;ll have to admit it if he wants the ladder.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>A Jar for Later</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-jar-for-later\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-jar-for-later\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-jar-for-later\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-jar-for-later\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-jar-for-later\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Ada Fen says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-jar-for-later\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}